1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,700
平安夜快樂 艾麗克斯
Merry Christmas Eve, Alex.

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,340
他還活著啊
So, he's still alive --

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,820
你一定還沒跟媽媽說你懷孕的事吧
must mean you haven't told Mom you're pregnant yet.

4
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:10,460
我們想謹慎處理好這件事
We want to be careful to do it right.

5
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,980
現在你倒知道謹慎了
Now you're being careful?

6
00:00:12,208 --> 00:00:13,828
我沒辦法再保守秘密了
I can't keep this secret anymore.

7
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:14,720
看看我
Look at me!

8
00:00:15,238 --> 00:00:16,778
她頭發都發白了
Ugh. She's going gray.

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,980
我的天 還真是
Oh my God, she is!

10
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,580
我剛才是在驚訝她的丑發型呢
I was just gasping at the haircut.

11
00:00:19,688 --> 00:00:23,208
我現在似乎一有壓力就會這樣
Apparently, this is what happens when I feel stress now.

12
00:00:23,208 --> 00:00:25,058
好吧 我們一定會在今天告訴他們 好嗎
Well, we're telling them today, okay?

13
00:00:25,058 --> 00:00:26,638
這樣的話 就算媽媽生氣
That way, if Mom freaks,

14
00:00:26,638 --> 00:00:29,188
她也有十天的時間在百慕大冷靜下來
she'll have 10 days in Bermuda to calm down.

15
00:00:29,188 --> 00:00:30,698
行啊 那現在就去啊
Okay, then go now!

16
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,680
她不會有比平安夜心情更好的時候了
She's never in a better mood than on Christmas Eve.

17
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,220
等一下 這樣告訴她怎么樣
Wait, is this a good way to tell her?

18
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:36,160
我們掛只襪子給"克萊爾外婆"
We hang a stocking for "Grandma Claire,"

19
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,720
然后當她說"我不是外婆"的時候
and when she goes, "I'm not a grandma,"

20
00:00:37,767 --> 00:00:40,537
我們就說 跟海莉和我"滴"寶寶說去吧
we go, "Tell that to Haley and my's baby."

21
00:00:41,647 --> 00:00:44,167
答應我 送孩子去上學 別留家教育
Promise me you won't home school this kid.

22
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,740
媽媽 你在干嘛呢
Hey, Mom. What are you doing?

23
00:00:47,657 --> 00:00:50,527
圣誕賀卡就是一堆廢紙
Ugh, Christmas cards are just clutter.

24
00:00:50,527 --> 00:00:51,367
等下等下等下
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

25
00:00:51,367 --> 00:00:53,136
你可不能扔掉小卡舅舅的賀卡
You can't throw away Uncle Cam's card.

26
00:00:53,136 --> 00:00:56,146
你知道他對鋼琴上的布局有多敏感
You know how sensitive he gets about his piano placement.

27
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:58,320
還記得那年他的賀卡
Remember that one year where his card

28
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,580
比我們家老保姆的卡片放得靠后了一點嗎
was slightly behind the one from our old babysitter?

29
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:02,840
我想他用了句迷人的措辭
Mm, I believe he spoke the charming phrase,

30
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,480
"這臭婊子是誰"
"And who is this whore?"

31
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:06,780
今年圣誕節在外公家過
Well, Christmas is at Grandpa's this year,

32
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:08,920
所以小卡不會看到它的
so Cam will never see it.

33
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,720
看看這些滑雪橇的北極熊包裝紙
Check out the sledding polar bear paper.

34
00:01:11,826 --> 00:01:13,806
看到它不由自主就會有好心情 對吧
Can't look at that and not be in a good mood, huh?

35
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:14,320
可不是嗎
Yeah.

36
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:16,340
我討厭這玩意兒
I am so sick of that stuff.

37
00:01:16,340 --> 00:01:19,120
我為了學校活動跟某孩子訂了5卷
I ordered five rolls from some kid for a school drive.

38
00:01:19,275 --> 00:01:21,905
結果他帶來了50卷... 他的錯
He shows up with fifty -- his fault.

39
00:01:21,905 --> 00:01:23,245
這孩子就哭了起來
Kid bursts into tears.

40
00:01:23,245 --> 00:01:25,365
好像他不會數數是我的錯
Like it's on me that he can't count?

41
00:01:25,365 --> 00:01:26,895
-我那時才六歲 媽媽 -行吧
-I was six, Mom. -Mm.

42
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,200
去百慕大就該這樣穿
Bermuda just gets it --

43
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:33,720
正式卻不失休閑
formal yet casual.

44
00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:35,980
而且還能看到世界上曬黑最完美的
And home of the most perfectly tanned

45
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:38,440
大腿下部和膝蓋上部區域
lower thigh, upper knee region in the world.

46
00:01:38,554 --> 00:01:40,854
以后在更衣室要找到百慕大同鄉就很容易了
Not hard to pick out a Bermudan in a locker room.

47
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,300
別了吧 等一下
No. Oh, hang on.

48
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,680
等等 這不對啊
Wait. Well, this can't be right.

49
00:01:45,820 --> 00:01:47,820
這個行程表上說我們有四個航班
This itinerary says we're on four flights

50
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:49,060
和三次中轉
with three layovers.

51
00:01:49,424 --> 00:01:50,244
是啊
Oh, yeah, um...

52
00:01:50,244 --> 00:01:52,974
記得我在網上找到那個很棒的機票嗎
remember how I found that amazing airline deal online?

53
00:01:52,974 --> 00:01:55,814
記得 可是其中兩個中轉長達六個小時
Yeah, but two of these layovers are six hours each.

54
00:01:55,860 --> 00:01:57,940
是啊 但第三個只有十二分鐘呢
Yes, but the third one's only 12 minutes.

55
00:01:57,974 --> 00:01:59,023
但那是在奧黑爾機場
But it's at O'Hare.

56
00:01:59,023 --> 00:02:00,403
親愛的 我們得在十二分鐘內
Honey, we'll have to sprint

57
00:02:00,403 --> 00:02:01,793
從機場的這頭跑到那頭
from one end of the airport to the other.

58
00:02:01,793 --> 00:02:04,543
當我們12月27日在百慕大醒來的時候
It'll all be worth it when we wake up on December 27th

59
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:07,160
一切都是值得的 那里天氣預報顯示...
in Bermuda, where the forecast predicts...

60
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,360
熱霧
hot fog.

61
00:02:08,780 --> 00:02:10,080
我們就不能坐直達班機嗎
Can't we just take a direct flight?

62
00:02:10,180 --> 00:02:12,260
不能變更 條款寫得很清楚
There's no changes, the terms were very clear.

63
00:02:12,383 --> 00:02:14,513
這是一個新網站促銷活動
It was part of a promotion for a new website

64
00:02:14,513 --> 00:02:16,134
那網站叫做機.票網
called Tickets.Plane

65
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:19,020
對了 我要在附近帶人看房
Oh, yeah, I have a showing right down the street.

66
00:02:19,380 --> 00:02:20,580
好的 等一下
Okay. Wait, hang on.

67
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:21,420
先別急著走
Don't leave. Don't leave.

68
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:23,120
低等經濟艙是什么
What is Economy Minus?

69
00:02:23,492 --> 00:02:26,312
其實應該是升等才對
A plus, actually,

70
00:02:26,362 --> 00:02:28,342
因為這艙里沒有人會嫉妒坐不到走道位
since no one's jealous of people with aisle seats,

71
00:02:28,342 --> 00:02:32,482
這基本上是兩排創新的十八人長椅
because it's basically two innovative 18-person benches

72
00:02:32,482 --> 00:02:34,142
面對面放著
facing each other.

73
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:34,860
菲爾
Phil?!

74
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,800
-什么事 -沒事
- What? - Nothing.

75
00:02:55,620 --> 00:02:57,140
誰動了小卡的賀卡
Who moved Cam's card?

76
00:02:57,181 --> 00:02:59,861
如果不放在壁爐上小卡會很不開心的
He's gonna be very upset if he's not on the mantel!

77
00:02:59,861 --> 00:03:01,351
我把它放在抽屜里了 等他來再拿出來
I put it in a drawer until he gets here.

78
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,800
上面的閃粉粘得到處都是
That glitter was getting on everything.

79
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:04,980
我還吸進了一點
I breathed some of that in.

80
00:03:05,070 --> 00:03:07,030
我現在咳出的都是金粉
I cough gold now.

81
00:03:07,260 --> 00:03:09,380
歌洛莉亞 你有一個哥倫比亞來的包裹
Gloria, you got a package from Colombia.

82
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:11,660
看來你們政府拿回飛機跑道了
Must mean the government took back the airstrip.

83
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:14,800
那是我親戚們送的禮物
Those are the gifts from my cousins!

84
00:03:17,580 --> 00:03:18,060
真好看
Beautiful!

85
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:22,760
在老家我們叫它"毛衣之圣誕[西語]"
Back home we call these sueteres de Navidad.

86
00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:24,840
所以就是圣誕毛衣唄
So...Christmas sweaters.

87
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:27,180
快穿上 我們來拍張照
Put them on so we can take a picture.

88
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,220
這毛衣真柔軟
Wow, these are really soft.

89
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,780
可舒適保暖了
Damn cozy is what they are.

90
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:35,459
看 他們還送了香蕉葉花環
Oh, look, they also sent a banana leaf wreath.

91
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:37,260
香蕉蜘蛛
Banana spider!

92
00:03:37,499 --> 00:03:38,263
-什么 -那是什么鬼玩意
- What?! - What is that?!

93
00:03:38,263 --> 00:03:40,349
是一種致命毒蜘蛛 能殺死人的
It's a deadly spider! It will kill you!

94
00:03:40,349 --> 00:03:41,309
我知道致命是什么意思
I know what deadly means!

95
00:03:41,309 --> 00:03:42,239
它去哪了
Well, where'd it go?

96
00:03:42,239 --> 00:03:43,659
我的家居鞋不包腳后跟
I'm wearing backless house slippers!

97
00:03:43,659 --> 00:03:44,940
我覺得它跑到
I think it ran over to the --

98
00:03:46,489 --> 00:03:48,118
它占領圣誕樹了
He took the tree!

99
00:03:48,398 --> 00:03:50,928
只有我覺得有點癢嗎
Am I the only one who feels kinda itchy?

100
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:51,560
毛衣有問題
The sweaters.

101
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:54,560
明處有一只 暗處上百千
Where there's one, there's many!

102
00:03:54,598 --> 00:03:55,529
-快跑 -我們走
- Run! - Let's go!

103
00:03:58,060 --> 00:03:59,800
老天 它占領到遙控器了
Dear God, he's got the remote.

104
00:04:02,028 --> 00:04:03,348
來笑一個
Okay, smile!

105
00:04:03,348 --> 00:04:04,708
這個完了我們能去看看手機嗎
Can we go look at phones after this?

106
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:07,300
不行 莉莉 圣誕節不能給你手機當禮物
No, Lily, you are not getting a cell phone for Christmas.

107
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,300
手機很貴 你還沒有證明自己
They're expensive, and you haven't proven yourself

108
00:04:09,300 --> 00:04:11,300
有足夠的責任感擁有自己的一部手機
responsible enough to own one yet.

109
00:04:11,377 --> 00:04:14,307
我夠有責任感了 我都到一個陌生的國家
Uh, I was responsible enough to come to a foreign country

110
00:04:14,307 --> 00:04:15,907
和兩個陌生人過日子了
and build a life with two strangers.

111
00:04:15,907 --> 00:04:18,207
你想晚點睡覺的時候用過這理由了
Okay, you used that one to get a later bedtime, all right?

112
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:19,480
卡爾 你是下一個
Oh, Cal, you're next.

113
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,980
我們想給卡爾一個完美圣誕
We want Cal to have a perfect Christmas.

114
00:04:24,180 --> 00:04:26,140
這挺有難度 畢竟他媽媽在監獄
It's tough with his mom being in prison.

115
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:29,040
另外 他的圣誕季開始得有點糟糕
Plus, his holiday season kind of got off to a rough start.

116
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:32,580
你知道嗎 我們選的所有裝飾品里
You know, of all of our wonderful ornament selects,

117
00:04:32,580 --> 00:04:33,560
這倆是我的最愛
these are my fave.

118
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:34,940
圣誕快樂[M.C]
Merry Christmas!

119
00:04:35,380 --> 00:04:36,620
也是米奇和小卡的首字母縮寫
From Mitch and Cam!

120
00:04:37,456 --> 00:04:39,856
? 馴鹿屋頂上停下來 ?
♪ Up on the rooftop, reindeer pause ♪

121
00:04:39,856 --> 00:04:42,296
? 圣誕老人蹦下雪橇 ?
♪ Out jumps good old Santa Claus ♪

122
00:04:42,296 --> 00:04:44,706
? 背著玩具爬下煙囪 ?
♪ Down through the chimney with lots of toys ♪

123
00:04:44,706 --> 00:04:47,396
? 帶給孩子們圣誕歡樂 ?
♪ All for the little ones' Christmas joy ♪

124
00:04:47,396 --> 00:04:49,705
? 呵呵呵 誰不想來呢 ?
♪ Ho, ho, ho, who wouldn't go? ♪

125
00:04:49,726 --> 00:04:52,275
? 呵呵呵 誰不想來呢 ?
♪ Ho, ho, ho, who wouldn't go? ♪

126
00:04:52,336 --> 00:04:54,685
? 圣誕老人屋頂上 嗒嗒嗒 ?
♪ Up on the housetop, click, click, click ♪

127
00:04:56,485 --> 00:04:58,265
-他沒事 真的沒事 -挺好的
- He was fine. Fine! - He was fine.

128
00:04:58,380 --> 00:04:59,820
我們還沒唱完三節和一段合唱
We barely got through three verses

129
00:04:59,825 --> 00:05:02,415
就反應過來自己的過失了
and a repeat chorus before we realized our mistake.

130
00:05:02,415 --> 00:05:04,785
-這么"短"時間還下了場暴風雨 -是啊
- Although that rainstorm came out of nowhere. - Yeah.

131
00:05:05,140 --> 00:05:07,180
圣誕快樂 小卡爾
Merry Christmas, little Cal!

132
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:09,620
莉莉 帶你表弟過去玩一會兒
Lily, take your cousin over there. Relax a little.

133
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,360
去吧
Okay, go.

134
00:05:10,395 --> 00:05:12,055
-你好 -你好
- Hi! - Hi!

135
00:05:12,055 --> 00:05:14,415
圣誕老人 不知道你能不能幫我們一個小忙
Hey, Santa. So, just wondering if you could you do us a favor

136
00:05:14,460 --> 00:05:17,380
告訴我們小侄子想要什么圣誕禮物
and tell us what our nephew just asked for for Christmas?

137
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:19,320
我認識你 你是那個律師
I know you. You're that lawyer.

138
00:05:19,620 --> 00:05:20,860
完了 這么一開頭就沒好事
Oh, no. This is never good.

139
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:23,400
你是那個指控我公共場合酗酒的助理地檢
You're the ADA who charged me with public intoxication.

140
00:05:23,474 --> 00:05:26,204
給我判了五十個小時社區服務
Got me sentenced to fifty hours community service --

141
00:05:26,204 --> 00:05:28,214
包括為商場扮圣誕老人
working as a mall Santa is part of it.

142
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:30,960
真的抱歉 我們能大人不記小人過嗎
Okay. Well, I'm sorry. But can't we move past that?

143
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,900
我們真的需要知道小侄子想要什么
We really need to know what our nephew asked for.

144
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,360
他想要更寬松的司法體系
He asked for a more lenient justice system.

145
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,560
我不太相信 他立場挺保守派
Well, I doubt that. He's pretty conservative.

146
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,960
我們不能承認關系 只能假裝室友
We have to pretend to be roommates.

147
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:40,680
我們能趕緊的嗎
Can we move this along?

148
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,820
這周我只能和孩子待四個小時
I only have my kids for four hours this week.

149
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:44,100
圣誕快樂 司法萬歲
Merry Christmas.

150
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:46,260
你知道 作為一個前任商場圣誕老人
You know what? As a former mall Santa,

151
00:05:46,273 --> 00:05:48,393
我發過誓不評判一個在崗的圣誕老人
I vowed never to comment on a sitting Santa,

152
00:05:48,540 --> 00:05:50,260
但是你真讓這紅白制服丟臉
but you're a disgrace to the red and white.

153
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:53,020
菲爾 我剛和我爸通完電話
Phil, I just got off the phone with my dad.

154
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,860
平安夜要挪到我們家過了
We're moving Christmas Eve to our house.

155
00:05:54,883 --> 00:05:56,143
我得趕緊出去買點雜貨
I got to run out and get some groceries.

156
00:05:56,220 --> 00:05:57,060
一會見 拜
See you soon. Bye.

157
00:05:58,273 --> 00:06:00,492
圣誕樹呢
Where's the tree?

158
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:01,440
禮物都到哪去了
Where are the gifts?

159
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:06,320
我想你取消過圣誕節 因為你發現我...
I assumed you canceled Christmas because you found out that I --

160
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,420
不過我打斷你說話了
But I interrupted you.

161
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,260
你爸是不是把東西拿去賣房那里了
Did your dad take them to his showing?

162
00:06:09,672 --> 00:06:11,972
他總干這種事 把我的裝飾偷拿走
He's always doing this -- he steals my decorations

163
00:06:11,972 --> 00:06:14,022
去布置他賣的房子 增加家庭氣息
to stage his houses to make them homier.

164
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,760
他保證過不會再犯的
He swore he would stop doing this!

165
00:06:16,542 --> 00:06:17,723
至少他沒拿走"發環"
At least he left the "Wreaf."

166
00:06:17,982 --> 00:06:18,972
是花環
Wreath.

167
00:06:18,972 --> 00:06:20,421
兩種發音我都有聽人說過啦
Eh, I've heard it both ways.

168
00:06:20,421 --> 00:06:22,781
我也聽過 但不代表是對的
No, I have, too. Doesn't make it right.

169
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,180
我們該如何是好
What are we supposed to do?

170
00:06:24,220 --> 00:06:26,320
沒有圣誕樹 就沒法辦圣誕節晚宴了
We can't host a Christmas without a tree.

171
00:06:26,540 --> 00:06:28,340
經過去年的事件后 他們不是不準你
I thought you weren't allowed to host Christmas anymore

172
00:06:28,340 --> 00:06:29,160
再辦圣誕節晚宴了嗎
after last year.

173
00:06:31,091 --> 00:06:34,151
我突發妙想 用創新方法烹飪了火雞
I took a swing at a new way to prepare turkey.

174
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:37,660
火雞都沒解凍
Well, this is frozen.

175
00:06:37,811 --> 00:06:39,591
不是的 爸爸 你只是切到了骨頭
No, Dad, you just -- you hit a bone.

176
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:40,940
我從《頂級大廚》學到的
I saw this on "Top Chef."

177
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:43,760
他們只用一小時就煮好了一整只火雞
They cooked an entire turkey in one hour.

178
00:06:43,870 --> 00:06:45,750
盧克已經吃了 你還好好的 對吧
Luke had some, you're fine. Aren't you, buddy?

179
00:06:46,940 --> 00:06:47,800
看喬有沒有事
Check on Joe.

180
00:06:54,650 --> 00:06:57,310
你爸不接電話
Oh, your father isn't answering.

181
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,140
這事你一定知情 對吧
You knew about this, didn't you?

182
00:06:59,340 --> 00:07:00,660
我能看出來你心里藏了秘密
I could tell you were hiding something.

183
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:05,460
菲爾
Phil?

184
00:07:06,780 --> 00:07:07,300
菲爾
Phil!

185
00:07:08,459 --> 00:07:09,500
菲...
Ph-- Oh!

186
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:12,480
這間家庭影院完全隔音
This theater is totally soundproof,

187
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,320
所以不會有人聽到你大聲吼吉姆
so no one will hear you yelling at Jim

188
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:15,980
叫他把襪子撿起來 桑迪
to pick up his socks, Sandy.

189
00:07:16,340 --> 00:07:17,240
她有時的確"很大聲"
She does get loud.

190
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:23,460
這房子優點多多
So, all of this,

191
00:07:23,569 --> 00:07:26,028
而且還在很好的學區里
plus it's in a great school dist...rict.

192
00:07:26,028 --> 00:07:28,168
老天 這房子剛被搶劫了嗎
Oh my God, was this house just robbed?

193
00:07:28,168 --> 00:07:29,978
我就跟你說這一區很亂吧
I told you this was a sketchy area.

194
00:07:30,260 --> 00:07:31,880
我不要再經歷一次入室搶劫
I am not going through another home invasion

195
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:34,200
而我和孩子們在安全屋外狂錘門你都不開
with the kids and me banging on the panic room door.

196
00:07:34,918 --> 00:07:37,908
你們慢慢聊 我看看
So, you guys chat, and I'll, uh, take a minute,

197
00:07:37,908 --> 00:07:40,198
能不能找到替代的圣誕樹
see if I can find a replacement tree

198
00:07:40,198 --> 00:07:42,538
以及九份包裝紙一模一樣的禮物
and nine identically wrapped gifts.

199
00:07:43,780 --> 00:07:46,060
這辦法一定能讓你媽心情變好
It's the perfect way to get your mom in a good mood.

200
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:48,400
你想想啊 杯子蛋糕就是小蛋糕
Think about it -- cupcakes are little cakes

201
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:50,020
就像嬰兒就是小人兒
just like babies are little people.

202
00:07:50,220 --> 00:07:50,920
應該吧
I guess.

203
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,620
我只是希望一切能順利進行
I just want this to go well.

204
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,440
懷了這個孩子 我很開心
I'm in a really good place with this baby,

205
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:55,620
我希望媽媽也為此開心
and I want my mom to be, too.

206
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,440
她今早心情不是很好
She wasn't in the best mood this morning.

207
00:07:58,700 --> 00:07:59,620
今天是平安夜
It's Christmas Eve.

208
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:01,620
她不可能一整天都像變相怪杰一樣臉色發青
She can't stay a Grinch all day.

209
00:08:09,346 --> 00:08:12,196
謝謝 我跟除蟲人員聯系過了
Thank you. That was the exterminator.

210
00:08:12,196 --> 00:08:13,656
他馬上趕過來
He is, uh, on his way,

211
00:08:13,656 --> 00:08:16,026
但除蟲那幾天 他得用帳篷把房子圍起來
but he's gonna have to tent the house for a couple of days.

212
00:08:16,026 --> 00:08:17,206
我打算給我們訂酒店
And I'm trying to book us a hotel,

213
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,500
但電話總斷線
but the call keeps dropping.

214
00:08:18,716 --> 00:08:21,296
喬 我們到后院去 那里信號比較好
Joe, let's go to the backyard. There's better reception.

215
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,500
聽著 我有東西落屋里了
Hey, listen. I left something inside.

216
00:08:24,500 --> 00:08:27,000
你得去幫我拿出來 這應該能保你平安
I need you to get it for me. This should keep you safe.

217
00:08:27,020 --> 00:08:29,340
你瘋了嗎 我才不要回去那個蜘蛛巢穴
Are you crazy? I'm not going back into that spider's nest.

218
00:08:29,740 --> 00:08:30,660
好吧 我也討厭蜘蛛
Fine, I hate them, too.

219
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:33,480
問題是 我身上的雄性麝香會吸引它們
The problem is, they're attracted to my musk.

220
00:08:33,575 --> 00:08:35,535
前不久我到動物園里的昆蟲間
I went to the insect room at the zoo a while back,

221
00:08:35,535 --> 00:08:37,425
它們馬上像犯人一樣開始狂拍玻璃
and they all started banging on the glass like inmates.

222
00:08:37,425 --> 00:08:38,985
你落什么在屋里了 這么重要
What'd you leave in there that's so important?

223
00:08:38,985 --> 00:08:39,945
是藥
It's a medication.

224
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:42,380
我沒事 但我沒告訴你媽
I'm fine, but I didn't tell your mom

225
00:08:42,385 --> 00:08:43,705
因為我不想她擔心
'cause I didn't want her to worry.

226
00:08:43,705 --> 00:08:44,895
我們不能順路到酒水商店
Can we just stop by a liquor store

227
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:45,980
幫你加滿"處方藥"嗎
and refill your "Prescription."

228
00:08:46,060 --> 00:08:47,180
都說了是藥 聽著
It's a medicine! Look...

229
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:50,520
我們住的酒店一定有頂級水療
I'm sure our hotel has a top notch spa.

230
00:08:50,675 --> 00:08:53,244
也許還能加個熱石按摩
One that might add a, uh, hot stone massage,

231
00:08:53,244 --> 00:08:54,684
和花草浸浴
an herbal soak...

232
00:08:54,684 --> 00:08:56,304
我像是會被物質收買的人嗎
Do I look like someone who can be bought?

233
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:58,180
不像 但你看起來應該會喜歡
No, but you do look like someone who might enjoy

234
00:08:58,180 --> 00:09:00,580
四手巴厘島式海藻按摩
a four-handed Balinese seaweed swaddle.

235
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:03,520
你個奸詐的老混蛋
You son of a bitch.

236
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:08,480
卡爾 你跟圣誕老人聊什么啦
So, Cal, what did you and Santa talk about?

237
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:09,580
那是秘密
It's a secret.

238
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:11,520
我 現金就行
Me, I'd be fine with just cash.

239
00:09:11,660 --> 00:09:12,680
你們要煩心的事夠多了 給你們減輕負擔
You guys have enough on your plate.

240
00:09:12,740 --> 00:09:14,380
你也別想自己去買個電話 好吧
Okay, you're not buying yourself a phone, all right?

241
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:15,600
圣誕老人休息了
Ooh, Santa's on break.

242
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,820
莉莉 去和卡爾坐在一起
Okay, Lily, go sit with Cal again.

243
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:20,340
你們要我幫忙 好歹加個請字吧
You guys need me -- maybe throw a please in there.

244
00:09:20,423 --> 00:09:22,563
-好的 嗨 -嗨
- Yeah. Hi! - Hi!

245
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,800
真的是一年中最美好的時刻
Oh, it really is the most wonderful time of the year.

246
00:09:24,873 --> 00:09:26,723
-真美好 -不是嗎 你介不介意
- Beautiful. - Isn't it? So, listen, do you mind if --

247
00:09:26,723 --> 00:09:27,503
你們覺得你們是第一個
Do you think you're the first parents

248
00:09:27,620 --> 00:09:28,840
想偷看我名冊的家長嗎
wanting to take a peek at my scroll?

249
00:09:29,233 --> 00:09:30,733
最好在我的靴子[屁股]里塞點東西
Better stick something in my bootie.

250
00:09:30,733 --> 00:09:32,413
-哇 哇 -什么鬼
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. - I'm sorry. What?

251
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,920
塞錢在我鞋子里 變態
Cash in the slipper, perv.

252
00:09:34,843 --> 00:09:36,433
-你 -嗯 我有
- Oh. Do you wanna... - Yeah, yeah, I got -- I got,

253
00:09:36,752 --> 00:09:38,102
我有十塊
uh -- I've got $10.

254
00:09:38,380 --> 00:09:39,160
謝謝
Thank you.

255
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:41,360
不 這只是玩具列表
No, this is just a list of toys.

256
00:09:41,412 --> 00:09:43,222
孩子的名字沒在上面
None of the kids' names are next to them.

257
00:09:43,222 --> 00:09:44,552
你知道嗎
Oh, oh. You know what?

258
00:09:44,552 --> 00:09:46,362
我們看下卡爾排隊的照片
Uh, we'll look at pictures of Cal in line

259
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,280
把他之后的孩子
and then match the kids up behind him

260
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,440
和單子上的玩具連在一起
with the toys on the list.

261
00:09:49,502 --> 00:09:51,082
好 我猜這個亞洲小孩
Okay, so, well, I guess this Asian kid,

262
00:09:51,082 --> 00:09:52,152
他可能想要個...
he maybe wants the, uh --

263
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,520
沒時間在這里回避種族刻板印象了
There's no time to be politically correct.

264
00:09:53,632 --> 00:09:54,392
-他想要個計算器 -計算器
- He wants the calculator. - Calculator.

265
00:09:54,392 --> 00:09:55,522
他特別想要
And he wants it bad. Yeah.

266
00:09:55,522 --> 00:09:56,322
等下 那意味著
Wait, does that mean that

267
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,200
這個小男孩想要芭比造型頭嗎
this little boy wants the Barbie Styling Head?

268
00:09:58,280 --> 00:09:59,380
沒錯 看那精心打扮的腳
Yep, look at the turned-out foot.

269
00:09:59,660 --> 00:10:01,280
他當然是想要芭比造型頭
Oh, of course he wants the Barbie Styling Head.

270
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:03,460
這就意味著卡爾想要
Which means Cal wants...

271
00:10:03,460 --> 00:10:03,760
風火輪小汽車
Hot Wheels!

272
00:10:03,961 --> 00:10:05,631
好的
Okay, okay.

273
00:10:05,631 --> 00:10:07,881
-我們走 謝謝 -謝謝
- Let's go. Thank you! - Thank you.

274
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:11,500
別擔心 他們會回來的
Don't worry. They come back.

275
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,360
求你告訴我你們已經去說了
Please tell me you told Mom and Dad.

276
00:10:16,611 --> 00:10:18,451
沒 但我們會用歌聲告訴你們爸媽
No, but we're gonna tell them in song.

277
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:19,960
聽聽這部分
Listen to this part.

278
00:10:19,961 --> 00:10:22,850
? 很快像我們一樣可愛的寶寶 ?
♪ Soon a baby as cute as us ♪

279
00:10:22,980 --> 00:10:25,440
? 會從海莉的子宮里出來 ?
♪ Will spring forth from Haley's uterus ♪

280
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:26,740
我好喜歡
I love it!

281
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,580
她在騙人 她就想我們趕快說
She's lying. She just wants us

282
00:10:28,580 --> 00:10:30,200
這樣她的濕疹就會消失
to get it over with so her eczema will go away.

283
00:10:30,300 --> 00:10:32,260
我才沒有 天啊
I don't have -- Oh, my God!

284
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:35,120
好 你記著
Okay, you got this.

285
00:10:35,210 --> 00:10:36,370
你比那些東西速度更快
You're quicker than those things.

286
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:37,620
-我很懷疑 -你更聰明
- I doubt that. - You're smarter.

287
00:10:37,820 --> 00:10:39,100
巧婦難為無米之炊
I can't make a web out of nothing.

288
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:41,480
-你還有武器 -吹葉機嗎
- Plus, you got a weapon. - A leaf blower?

289
00:10:41,620 --> 00:10:43,880
這家伙能把博美犬吹過籬笆
Hey, that thing can blow a Pomeranian through a hedge.

290
00:10:44,180 --> 00:10:46,040
這么說吧 隔壁的小咪咪
Let's just say little Mimi from next door

291
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:47,560
再不會來我們家草坪了
won't be visiting our lawn anymore.

292
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,400
趁你媽沒回來 快點
Now hurry up before your mom gets back.

293
00:10:50,300 --> 00:10:52,140
我們保持聯系
We'll be in constant communication.

294
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:54,440
快 快 快
Go. Go, go, go.

295
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:56,180
保持警惕
Keep your head on a swivel.

296
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,660
去我的浴室 記住
Head for my bathroom. Remember.

297
00:10:58,820 --> 00:11:01,380
那蜘蛛能覺察最微弱的恐懼
That spider can sense the subtlest sign of fear.

298
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:03,780
有東西爬過了我的腳
Something just ran past my foot.

299
00:11:08,700 --> 00:11:10,120
我去 停電了
Damn it, the power's out!

300
00:11:10,488 --> 00:11:11,788
我也要走了
Then so am I!

301
00:11:11,788 --> 00:11:13,738
別啊 你們現在勢均力敵了
No! You just leveled the playing field.

302
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:14,700
他們有四雙眼睛
They have eight eyes.

303
00:11:14,860 --> 00:11:15,980
你只有一雙
You only have two.

304
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,800
停電的話它們唯一的優勢也沒啦
You just took away their one advantage.

305
00:11:18,098 --> 00:11:19,868
它們的毒液呢
What about their sac of poison?

306
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,320
好 我到浴室了
Okay, I'm in the bathroom.

307
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,200
很好 很好 藥在
Good, good. The medication...

308
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:28,120
底下的柜子里
is down below in the cabinet.

309
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,500
你讓我把手伸進
You want me to reach my hand

310
00:11:29,500 --> 00:11:31,000
黑暗又潮濕的產卵區嗎
into a dark, damp breeding ground?

311
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:33,640
就在右后邊
It's all the way in the back on the far right.

312
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,660
用手摸著找那個罐子
Just feel around for the jar.

313
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:37,360
所以還要來回移動我的手
So, skitter my hand back and forth?

314
00:11:37,467 --> 00:11:39,467
這基本上就是蜘蛛求偶舞了
That's basically a spider mating dance!

315
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,000
拿到了
Got it.

316
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:47,900
回答我 完畢
Talk to me, over.

317
00:11:50,300 --> 00:11:50,780
曼尼
Manny!

318
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:54,900
還不走
Not leaving!

319
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:56,300
還要買
Still shopping!

320
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:59,560
被搶劫還不夠慘似的
As if getting robbed wasn't bad enough,

321
00:11:59,620 --> 00:12:00,860
現在讓我們搞圣誕聚餐
now that we were hosting Christmas,

322
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:03,200
我得在克萊爾回家前 把新的圣誕樹
I had to get a new tree and gifts into the house

323
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,220
和禮物搬進家里來
before Claire got home.

324
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:06,260
幸好我還有一份她的禮物清單
Fortunately, I had a copy of her gift list.

325
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:09,260
心里有點毛骨悚然
It was eerie how many of these events

326
00:12:09,260 --> 00:12:11,660
這么多的事情都跟我正在寫的童書情節重疊
were lining up with the plot of my children's book in progress,

327
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:13,120
我的書名叫《拯救圣誕的房產中介》
"The Realtor Who Saved Christmas."

328
00:12:14,740 --> 00:12:16,760
-你好 -哥們兒 幫個忙
- Hello? - Buddy, I need a favor.

329
00:12:16,860 --> 00:12:18,340
還記得上次因為你數學太爛
Remember that polar bear wrapping paper

330
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:20,400
害我們買了好多的北極熊包裝紙嗎
you made us buy so much of because you can't do math?

331
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:22,200
拿上幾卷
Grab a couple rolls of it,

332
00:12:22,340 --> 00:12:23,820
20分鐘后到家門外等我
meet me out in front of the house in 20 minutes.

333
00:12:24,065 --> 00:12:26,685
都用完了 老媽用了最后一卷包今年的禮物
We're all out. Mom used the last of it on this year's gifts.

334
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:30,240
該死 我需要很多 我要去哪...
Damn it! I need a bunch of it. Where am I supposed to f--

335
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:31,820
? 哈利路亞 ?
♪ Hallelujah ♪

336
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:34,180
? 哈利路亞 哈利路亞 ?
♪ Hallelujah, Hallelujah ♪

337
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,580
沒事了 盧克
All good, Luke.

338
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:53,160
我們買到了我們要的東西
Well, we got what we need.

339
00:12:53,300 --> 00:12:55,200
我很高興有人今年終于得到了他想要的
I'm glad someone's getting what they want this year.

340
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:56,420
這樣吧 我的手機給你
You know what? Here, take my phone.

341
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:58,600
如果你一天內沒搞丟 手機就歸你了
If you can get through a day without losing it, it's yours.

342
00:13:05,093 --> 00:13:07,123
你肯定是踩到什么發膠上了
You must've run through some hairspray.

343
00:13:07,123 --> 00:13:08,633
你的靴子現在跟捕蠅紙一樣
Your boots are like flypaper.

344
00:13:08,633 --> 00:13:09,903
所以那款膠才被禁用啊
That's why that spray was banned.

345
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:11,240
小鳥們飛過發膠工廠
Birds were flying over the factory

346
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,320
然后就會黏到一起
and getting stuck together.

347
00:13:13,903 --> 00:13:15,472
等等 等一下 等一下
Hey, wait, wait a second. Wait a second.

348
00:13:15,740 --> 00:13:16,920
這就是你的藥嗎
This is your medication?

349
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,060
"懷舊派胳膊肘潤滑霜"
"Good Old Fashioned Elbow Grease?"

350
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,620
我的手肘干得厲害
I suffer from dry elbow.

351
00:13:20,740 --> 00:13:22,140
我冒著生命危險就為了這個嗎
That's what I risked my life for?

352
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:25,560
光滑的手肘是所有叉腰姿勢的必備
Supple elbows are heavily featured in every good power pose.

353
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,020
我就是這樣登上《衣柜世界》的封面
That's how I got the cover to Closet World.

354
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:30,100
我真的是硬生生靠胳膊肘擠上去的
I literally elbowed my way to the top.

355
00:13:31,412 --> 00:13:32,782
我訂了個酒店
I booked us a hotel.

356
00:13:32,940 --> 00:13:34,900
曼尼 你跟喬同住一間
Manny, you're sharing a room with Joe.

357
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:36,820
這事你給我搞定
Fix that.

358
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:43,180
你在暖氣片上烤什么東西呢
What are you roasting on the space heater?

359
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:45,360
我之前把卡片扔到垃圾桶里
Oh, I threw those cards in the trash.

360
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:46,620
結果都泡濕了
They got all soggy.

361
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:47,840
連小卡舅舅的都是嗎
Even Uncle Cam's?

362
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:49,640
那些卡片你得留七年啊
You have to save those for seven years,

363
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:50,860
跟納稅申報單一樣
like tax returns.

364
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:04,410
你好呀 菲爾
Hello, Phil.

365
00:14:04,410 --> 00:14:05,510
沒錯
Oh, that's right.

366
00:14:05,540 --> 00:14:06,940
圣誕樹回歸原位了
The tree's back where it belongs.

367
00:14:06,940 --> 00:14:08,220
是你偷的
You stole it?!

368
00:14:08,460 --> 00:14:09,460
不 是你偷的
Oh, no, you did.

369
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:12,440
跟你以前偷了我的塑料感恩節火雞家族
Just like you stole my family of plastic Thanksgiving turkeys,

370
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:13,920
我的充氣復活節兔子
my inflatable Easter bunny,

371
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:15,730
還有我的山姆大叔彩陶罐一樣
and my Uncle Sam pinata,

372
00:14:15,760 --> 00:14:17,500
都搬到你的房屋開放日去了
all for your open houses.

373
00:14:17,900 --> 00:14:19,320
今天是洗清
Today was my chance

374
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:22,300
我冤情的機會
to shed a very unfair reputation.

375
00:14:22,369 --> 00:14:22,949
克萊爾
Claire --

376
00:14:22,949 --> 00:14:25,909
我只不過害兩個人進了醫院一次
I put two people in the hospital one time,

377
00:14:25,909 --> 00:14:27,749
大家就把我當圣誕節殺手
and now I'm a Christmas ruiner.

378
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:28,340
著火了
Fire!

379
00:14:28,860 --> 00:14:30,300
我的天哪 去拿滅火器
Oh, my God! Get the extinguisher!

380
00:14:31,589 --> 00:14:33,639
是小卡的閃粉賀卡 我就知道
Aah! It's Cam's glitter card! I knew it!

381
00:14:33,639 --> 00:14:34,760
后退
Stand back!

382
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:36,540
樹
The tree!

383
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:37,580
禮物
The gift

384
00:14:40,579 --> 00:14:41,430
這個 那個
The -- The --

385
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:43,640
用完了
It's out!

386
00:14:44,448 --> 00:14:47,518
我和盧克做噴氣背包時用的肯定是這滅火器
This must be the one Luke and I used for our jet pack prototype.

387
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:51,840
是我們太傻了 根本就沒什么完美的時間點
You know, we're being crazy. There is no perfect moment.

388
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:54,560
我們就像大人一樣上去知會一聲就行了
We're just going to walk in there like adults and tell them.

389
00:15:01,900 --> 00:15:02,380
親愛的
Honey...

390
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:03,500
沒救了
It's no use.

391
00:15:04,100 --> 00:15:04,960
一切都結束了 菲爾
It's over, Phil.

392
00:15:05,740 --> 00:15:06,880
這房子聞著一股煙味兒
The house smells like smoke,

393
00:15:06,980 --> 00:15:07,980
我們沒有圣誕樹
we have no tree

394
00:15:07,997 --> 00:15:11,177
還有九份燒焦又濕透的禮物
and nine scorched, yet soaking-wet gifts.

395
00:15:11,197 --> 00:15:13,177
最糟的是 米奇爾聽了肯定幸災樂禍
Worst of all, I have to make Mitchell's day

396
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:15,480
因為我得告訴他把聚會改到他家
by telling him we're moving the party to his house

397
00:15:15,737 --> 00:15:19,657
而我永遠不能再主辦聚會了
and I'm on permanent host probation forever.

398
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:20,960
誰知道呢
Who knows?

399
00:15:21,427 --> 00:15:24,817
或許幾年后他們會丟給我一個小破節日
Maybe in a couple years they'll toss me a pity holiday --

400
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:28,680
"歡迎來到我的無酒精地球日早午餐"
"Welcome to my non-alcoholic Earth Day brunch."

401
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:31,540
好消息是
In brighter news,

402
00:15:31,586 --> 00:15:33,746
幾小時后我就要坐上螺旋槳飛機了
I am getting on a prop plane in a couple hours.

403
00:15:34,386 --> 00:15:36,386
現在還有百慕大三角這回事吧
Bermuda Triangle's still a thing, right?

404
00:15:36,420 --> 00:15:36,700
克萊爾
Claire.

405
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,380
親愛的 我現在應付不來
Honey, I just can't right now.

406
00:15:39,380 --> 00:15:40,460
我沒心情
I'm not in the mood for --

407
00:15:44,100 --> 00:15:44,620
怎么做到的
How?

408
00:15:44,796 --> 00:15:46,316
我送你的圣誕快樂
Merry Christmas from me.

409
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:48,040
你之前偷偷跑出去
Did you sneak out earlier

410
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:49,580
買了這些東西掩蓋你的行為嗎
and buy all this stuff to cover your tracks?

411
00:15:50,225 --> 00:15:53,275
或者你可以選擇相信這是圣誕奇跡
Or you can choose to believe it's a Christmas miracle.

412
00:15:53,505 --> 00:15:54,736
我選擇奇跡
I choose miracle.

413
00:15:56,820 --> 00:15:57,860
節日快樂
Happy holidays!

414
00:16:00,465 --> 00:16:02,165
謝謝你們接手
Thank you for taking over.

415
00:16:02,165 --> 00:16:03,695
你拯救了一切 圣誕快樂
You saved the day! Merry Christmas.

416
00:16:03,740 --> 00:16:05,380
你知道的 我就是這么厲害
Well, you know, it's kind of what I do.

417
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,080
快來 飲料在廚房
Come on, drinks in the kitchen.

418
00:16:07,425 --> 00:16:09,954
-太好了 -太好了
- Yay! All right! - All right!

419
00:16:11,164 --> 00:16:13,254
曼尼 你頭上怎么起了個小包
Ooh, Manny, what's up with the noggin bump?

420
00:16:13,380 --> 00:16:14,200
什么 哪
What? Where?

421
00:16:14,674 --> 00:16:17,314
不 看起來像是香蕉蜘蛛咬的
Oh, no. That looks like a banana spider bite!

422
00:16:17,314 --> 00:16:18,684
不是咬的 他撞到了頭
It's not a bite, he bumped his head.

423
00:16:18,900 --> 00:16:20,080
不 看起來像被咬了
No, that looks like a bite.

424
00:16:20,104 --> 00:16:22,214
我姐姐被密蘇里青貯窖蜘蛛咬過
My sister got bit by a Missouri Silo Spider --

425
00:16:22,214 --> 00:16:23,274
失去了一根腳趾
lost a toe.

426
00:16:23,274 --> 00:16:25,954
但結局很好 她天生有十一根腳趾
Happy ending -- she was born with eleven.

427
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,640
曼尼 我們得去醫院檢查
Manny, we need to get that checked.

428
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:29,120
可以用解毒劑
There is an antidote,

429
00:16:29,134 --> 00:16:31,793
但假如你以前從沒被這種蜘蛛咬過
but if you have never been bitten by the spider,

430
00:16:31,793 --> 00:16:32,933
可能是致命的
it might kill you.

431
00:16:32,933 --> 00:16:34,403
-我們上車去 -杰
- Let's go to the car. - I -- Jay.

432
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,760
停下 他沒被咬
Stop! He wasn't bitten.

433
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:37,700
他撞到了頭 他之前回到房子里去
He bumped his head when he went back in the house

434
00:16:37,700 --> 00:16:39,300
幫我拿 藥
to grab my...medication.

435
00:16:40,340 --> 00:16:41,160
什么藥
What medication?

436
00:16:41,540 --> 00:16:42,900
我的天 爸 你還好嗎
Oh, my God, Dad, are you okay?

437
00:16:43,140 --> 00:16:44,640
我們會挺過去的 伙計
We're gonna get through this, buddy.

438
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:47,300
是一種胳膊肘霜 每天晚上
It's an elbow cream that I secretly use

439
00:16:47,300 --> 00:16:48,960
我都在歌洛莉亞睡著后偷偷用
every night after Gloria falls asleep.

440
00:16:49,173 --> 00:16:52,593
你讓咱兒子進入致命毒蛛的巢穴
You sent our son into the nest of a deadly spider

441
00:16:52,660 --> 00:16:53,760
就為了拿潤膚霜
for a beauty cream?

442
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:54,940
這是藥
It's a medicine

443
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:58,280
用來治療令人心碎的干胳膊肘癥
that treats the heartbreaking condition of dry elbow!

444
00:16:58,580 --> 00:17:00,960
這是獸醫才能開的處方藥
It requires a veterinarian's prescription

445
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:03,920
因為原本是給犀牛和大象用的
because it's primarily used on rhinos and elephants.

446
00:17:04,860 --> 00:17:08,360
看來盡管我們正朝完美社會大步前進
I see on our march to become a perfect society,

447
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:09,940
人們仍舊允許胳膊肘羞辱
elbow shaming is still allowed.

448
00:17:10,700 --> 00:17:12,600
我胳膊肘有時也有點干
I get a little dry sometimes.

449
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:15,500
你要記住你并不比別人差在哪里
Hey! You're just as much a person as everybody else.

450
00:17:15,601 --> 00:17:17,131
我不敢相信你虛榮到這個地步
I can't believe that you're so vain that you --

451
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,720
等等 你鞋底上粘的
Wait, is that my Christmas card

452
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,900
是我的圣誕賀卡嗎
stuck on the bottom of your shoe?

453
00:17:20,901 --> 00:17:22,891
為什么被燒焦了
And why-why is it singed?

454
00:17:22,891 --> 00:17:24,821
你不能再這么看重賀卡了
Ugh, you got to be less about the cards.

455
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:25,780
我們都這么想
We all think it.

456
00:17:26,360 --> 00:17:29,480
你不是在衛生間噴光了一罐強力發膠嗎
Didn't you empty a can of powerful hairspray in the bathroom?

457
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:30,880
你也去衛生間了嗎
And did you go in there, too?

458
00:17:33,380 --> 00:17:36,220
好吧 我得拿點東西 行了吧
Fine! I needed something, okay?

459
00:17:36,620 --> 00:17:38,660
但至少我是自己去拿的
But at least I went in myself.

460
00:17:38,970 --> 00:17:41,940
因為你用二十美元雇我我沒答應
After you offered me $20 and I said no.

461
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:43,820
我們中有些人是不會被收買的
Some of us can't be bought.

462
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,240
你要拿什么
What did you need?

463
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:47,800
無論是什么 我們會一起陪你挺過去
Whatever it is, we're gonna get through this.

464
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:49,380
防磨牙牙套
A night guard.

465
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:52,480
我不想告訴你 但每天晚上
I didn't want to tell you, but every night,

466
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:55,120
我都等你睡著后戴上
I wait for you to fall asleep, so I put it on.

467
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:56,840
太沒有吸引力了
It's so unattractive.

468
00:17:57,260 --> 00:17:58,080
就這樣
That's it?

469
00:17:58,299 --> 00:18:01,529
太不性感了 我看起來好丑
Ith not thex-thee. I look hideouth!

470
00:18:01,529 --> 00:18:03,899
終于從神性中蹦出點人味兒了
Oh, that really humanizes her.

471
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:05,380
我不喜歡
I don't care for it.

472
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:08,180
我的一顆牙都松了
Okay, one of my teeth is loose.

473
00:18:08,299 --> 00:18:09,689
我求求你去告訴他們吧
I am begging you to tell them.

474
00:18:09,840 --> 00:18:10,720
這就是我打扮的目的啊
That's what this is.

475
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:12,320
我打扮成圣誕老人并從煙囪落下
I'm coming down the chimney as Santa,

476
00:18:12,540 --> 00:18:13,760
討喬與卡爾開心
delighting Joe and Cal.

477
00:18:14,100 --> 00:18:15,800
媽能看到他跟孩子多投緣
Mom will see how good he is with kids

478
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:18,020
就會對我懷孕的事放心許多
and then be super chill with us being pregnant.

479
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:21,880
我卡住了
I'm stuck.

480
00:18:22,580 --> 00:18:24,200
好啦 大家都進來吧 全家福時間到
Okay, everybody, come on, picture time!

481
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,420
到圣誕樹前集合 來吧
In front of the tree, let's go.

482
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,400
天啊 你別出聲
Oh, God. Just be quiet!

483
00:18:26,580 --> 00:18:28,160
你在這里啊 對了 迪蘭呢
There you are. Okay, where's Dylan?

484
00:18:28,348 --> 00:18:29,549
媽 你真有心
Aww, Mom.

485
00:18:29,738 --> 00:18:31,328
想什么呢 我們需要有人幫忙拍照啊
What? We need somebody to take the picture.

486
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:32,320
太狠心了
Harsh.

487
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,080
什么聲音
What was that?

488
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:37,060
我們每年不是都會生火的嗎
Don't we always have the fire on?

489
00:18:37,460 --> 00:18:38,340
-沒有 -我挺確定有
- No! - I'm sure we do.

490
00:18:38,420 --> 00:18:41,120
我們去年用那火把克萊爾沒熟的火雞烤熟
Last year we used it to finish cooking Claire's turkey pieces.

491
00:18:41,620 --> 00:18:42,860
杰 去生火
Jay, go turn it on.

492
00:18:42,927 --> 00:18:43,907
等等 等等 等等
Wait! Wait, wait, wait.

493
00:18:43,907 --> 00:18:45,937
各位... 各位12歲以下小朋友先離開下
Every-- Everybody 12 and under, out.

494
00:18:46,207 --> 00:18:49,967
什么 親愛的 這是怎么了
What? Honey, what's going on?

495
00:18:50,460 --> 00:18:51,560
迪蘭卡在煙囪里了
Dylan's stuck in the chimney.

496
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:53,840
為什么
Why?

497
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:55,400
他打扮成圣誕老人
He's dressed up as Santa.

498
00:18:55,460 --> 00:18:57,080
想要從煙囪而降來給孩子發禮物
He was gonna hand presents out to the kids.

499
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:00,280
別現在告訴他們啊 我想跟你一起公布
Don't tell them now. I want to be with you!

500
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:02,000
告訴我們什么
Tell us what?

501
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,320
沒什么 可以之后再說
Nothing. It can wait.

502
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,880
不能再等了 求求你
No, it can't! Please!

503
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,620
我的全身器官都要停止運作了
My organs are shutting down!

504
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:07,840
好吧 行 我...
Okay, fine. I...

505
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:12,220
我們有個事情要宣布
We have an announcement.

506
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:16,240
我跟迪蘭要生寶寶了
Dylan and I are having a baby.

507
